1
00:00:00,364 --> 00:00:02,364
(Bernadette:)Want to pause the video game
and help me clean up?

2
00:00:02,533 --> 00:00:03,533
(Howard:)I am cleaning up.

3
00:00:03,701 --> 00:00:05,941
(Howard:)Look at the mess the Joker
made of Gotham City.

4
00:00:07,305 --> 00:00:09,975
(Bernadette:)Come on, it's your friend
who's coming to stay here.

5
00:00:10,141 --> 00:00:11,411
(Howard:)Raj grew up in India.

6
00:00:11,576 --> 00:00:12,886
(Howard:)Trust me, he's seen worse.

7
00:00:14,579 --> 00:00:15,559
(Bernadette:)Howie.

8
00:00:15,713 --> 00:00:17,783
(Howard:)I promise I'll help out
the rest of the week.

9
00:00:17,949 --> 00:00:18,929
(Bernadette:)The rest of the week?

10
00:00:19,083 --> 00:00:20,723
(Bernadette:)You said it was just
going to be a night or two.

11
00:00:20,885 --> 00:00:22,665
(Howard:)Yeah, but if I told you a week,
would you have said yes?

12
00:00:22,820 --> 00:00:25,230
-No!
-Then you left me no choice.

13
00:00:26,624 --> 00:00:29,934
(Bernadette:)I love Raj, but that's
a long time for a house guest.

14
00:00:30,294 --> 00:00:31,794
(Amy:)I know,
but they're tenting his building.

15
00:00:31,963 --> 00:00:34,173
(Howard:)He can't find a hotel
he likes that allows dogs.

16
00:00:34,332 --> 00:00:36,782
(Bernadette:)-He's bringing Cinnamon?
-For a whole week!

17
00:00:36,934 --> 00:00:38,174
(Howard:)The nerve of some people.

18
00:00:41,839 --> 00:00:45,409
(Sheldon:)Here comes
the Embarrassment Express.

19
00:00:46,277 --> 00:00:48,687
(Sheldon:)With stops at Fraudville...

20
00:00:48,846 --> 00:00:50,846
...WonderBIunderberg...

21
00:00:51,349 --> 00:00:54,189
(Sheldon:)...and Kansas City.

